// The people of Lunar Isle, the crew of the Lady Zay, the six Ethereal beings of the
// Dream World and the five things Cyrisus is afraid of - imported from the rev 474
// cache by scratchpad/importnpc_lunar.py (tools/models/importnpc474.py, plus chatheads
// and model sharing). Models are copied byte-for-byte; 474 model files are already in
// the format the 377 client reads. Combat stats, huntmode and drops are by hand below
// the import - the cache carries none of them.

